//! The `gap` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the gaps (also called `gutters`) between rows and columns on
//! [multi-column](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Multicol_layout),
//! [flex](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Flexible_box_layout), and
//! [grid](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Grid_layout) containers.
//!
//! Initial: row-gap: normal; column-gap: normal. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <'row-gap'> <'column-gap'>?
